   "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
   "text": "While 120 team-seasons are available, if the 'effect' is subtle or highly contextual (e.g., only against certain play types or offensive schemes), the effective sample size for detecting a statistically significant and reliable team trait might be insufficient after accounting for variability and controlling for confounding factors."
