   "code": "DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY",
   "text": "Team rosters, coaching staffs, and league-wide offensive/defensive strategies evolve season to season. A 'reliable team trait' measured over multiple seasons might be subject to drift, making it challenging to assess long-term reliability or requiring a more nuanced definition of reliability (e.g., within-season vs. across-season)."
