  "unit": "Defensive team-season.",
  "sample": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25 seasons for full team-season data. The 2025-26 regular season data will be used to calculate H2-H1 changes for teams, but not for full team-season reliability due to incompleteness. Teams with fewer than 30 games in a season will be excluded from that season's calculation. Focus on teams playing in at least two consecutive full seasons to assess inter-season reliability. Data from playoffs will be excluded due to different game contexts and smaller sample sizes.",
