  "multiplicity": "Only one primary estimand (inter-season correlation of opponent-adjusted H2-H1 PPP change) will be tested. No adjustments for multiplicity are required for this single primary test.",
  "decision_rule": "The hypothesis will be considered 'supported' if the inter-season correlation coefficient of the defensive trait (adjusted H2-H1 PPP change) is statistically significant (p < 0.05) and demonstrates a moderate effect size (e.g., Pearson r > 0.4). Otherwise, it will be 'rejected' (if adequately powered) or 'uncertain'.",
  "data_version": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, 2025-26 regular season data as available on 2026-10-06. Derived play-type possession records will be used. The latest available version of the play-by-play and derived data will be used."
 }
}

